                                deserialize(record.responseBody(), responseType), true, record.httpStatus());
                    }
                    if (winner.isEmpty()) {
                        // 胜者事务回滚，占位已消失，重新尝试受理。
                        break;
                    }
                    try {
                        Thread.sleep(CLAIM_POLL_MILLIS);
                    } catch (InterruptedException ex) {
